---
import AccountLayout from "../layouts/AccountLayout.astro";import "../styles/workspace-tools.css";
---
<AccountLayout title="Bulk Barcode Studio" current="bulk"><header class="portal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">One file, many operations</div><h1>Bulk Barcode Studio</h1><p>Look up, generate, validate, enrich or allocate SKUs in bounded batches.</p></div></header><p id="bulk-plan" class="workspace-plan"></p><p id="bulk-status" class="workspace-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Prepare a job</h2><form id="bulk-prepare"><fieldset id="bulk-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><label>CSV or XLSX file<input id="bulk-file" type="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" required /></label><label>Operation<select id="bulk-operation"><option value="validate">Validate GTIN checksums</option><option value="generate">Generate SVG barcode ZIP</option><option value="lookup">Look up products</option><option value="enrich">Enrich product data</option><option value="sku">Generate internal SKUs</option></select></label><label>Generation format<select id="bulk-symbology"><option value="ean13">EAN-13</option><option value="ean8">EAN-8</option><option value="upca">UPC-A</option><option value="code128">Code 128</option><option value="code39">Code 39</option><option value="qr">QR Code</option></select></label><label>SKU prefix<input id="bulk-prefix" value="SKU" pattern="[A-Z0-9_-]{1,20}" maxlength="20" /></label><button type="submit" class="button button-signal">Prepare file</button></div></fieldset></form><p>Up to 1,000 rows and 5 MB per file. Use a barcode column (or value for generation); SKU allocation uses one row per code. Optional product_id associates each SKU with an unassigned saved product. Keep identifiers as text to retain leading zeros. Internal SKUs are not GS1 registrations.</p><p>Processing runs while this page stays open. Validation, graphics and ZIP assembly use a browser worker. Files and completed results remain in this tab until you leave. No background queue or uploaded-file storage is created.</p></section><section id="bulk-job" class="workspace-panel" hidden><h2>Process file</h2><p id="bulk-preview"></p><progress id="bulk-progress" value="0" max="1" aria-label="Processing progress"></progress><p id="bulk-progress-text" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="bulk-start" type="button" class="button button-signal">Start / resume</button><button id="bulk-cancel" type="button" class="button button-secondary" disabled>Pause after current row or chunk</button><button id="bulk-retry" type="button" class="button button-secondary" disabled>Retry failed rows</button></div><p>Processing-row allowance applies separately from lookup, image generation, enrichment and SKU allowances. Validation/generation attempts consume their reserved units even when input is invalid. Repeating a paused generation or SKU chunk reuses its receipt. Retrying a lookup makes another lookup request and can use another credit. Enrichment only fills missing values in the downloaded result; saved catalogue records are untouched.</p><div class="workspace-actions">{["csv","xlsx","json"].map(format=><button type="button" class="button button-secondary" data-bulk-export={format} disabled>Export {format.toUpperCase()}</button>)}<button id="bulk-errors" type="button" class="button button-secondary" disabled>Error report JSON</button><button id="bulk-zip" type="button" class="button button-secondary" disabled>Download barcode ZIP</button></div><div class="workspace-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Bulk results"><table class="workspace-table"><thead><tr><th>Row</th><th>Identifier / SKU</th><th>Status</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody id="bulk-results"></tbody></table></div><p id="bulk-results-note">The latest 100 results are shown. Exports include every processed row.</p></section></AccountLayout>
<script src="../scripts/bulk-studio.ts"></script>
